Partial Bug Fixes:
Fixed UI blurriness caused by resolution adaptation issues on some devices;

Fixed incomplete display issue on narrow-screen monitors;

Fixed inability to select UI in fullscreen mode during gameplay (when changing resolution, please use fullscreen or windowed mode); 

Fixed game launch failure caused by outdated CPU models (if the game still cannot launch, please contact the admin - Technical);

Fixed issue where invoking the deity interface using number keys would prevent game progress; 

Fixed issue where after a feedback pop-up appeared in the room, an extra mouse click was needed before movement was possible; 

Fixed the issue of Elite Mage monster having excessively loud sound effects, and added them to the adjustable monster volume settings;  
Suggestions for Improving Frame Rate:
Lower the "Preset" in Settings (recommended first); 

Lower the "Environment" quality in Settings (recommended); 

Try lowering the "Super Resolution Quality" in Settings; changing resolution is not recommended;  

Other bug fixes are still in progress. 



-Darkfallen Survivors DEV
